{"id":"ab0d42b038181e67","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-fragile.md","title":"Fragile","display":"df-fragile — Fragile","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-fragile","aliases":["58-df-fragile"],"display":"df-fragile — Fragile","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-fragile"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-fragile</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fragile — Fragile"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md\">../batch15/58-df-forcing.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> (公式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,R,\\mathbf1_P,N,F_P,F_*\\in V\">\\(P,R,\\mathbf1_P,N,F_P,F_*\\in V\\)</span> (forcing order, greatest condition, set of forcing names, and two coded forcing relations)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (poset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FragileStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{FragileStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (explicit fragile-data predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fragile}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Fragile}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (existential projection retained for compatibility)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fragile\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FragileStructure}_S(\\varphi,P,R,\\mathbf1_P,N,F_P,F_*)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land\\mathbf1_P\\in P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land N\\subseteq V\\land F_P\\subseteq P\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\langle\\mathbf1_P,\\varphi\\rangle\\in F_P\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\dot Q\\in N\\;\\Bigl(\\langle\\mathbf1_P,\\ulcorner\\operatorname{Poset}(\\dot Q)\\urcorner\\rangle\\in F_P\\land\\langle\\dot Q,\\neg\\varphi\\rangle\\in F_*\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fragile\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FragileStructure}_S(\\varphi,P,R,\\mathbf1_P,N,F_P,F_*)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land\\mathbf1_P\\in P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land N\\subseteq V\\land F_P\\subseteq P\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\langle\\mathbf1_P,\\varphi\\rangle\\in F_P\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\dot Q\\in N\\;\\Bigl(\\langle\\mathbf1_P,\\ulcorner\\operatorname{Poset}(\\dot Q)\\urcorner\\rangle\\in F_P\\land\\langle\\dot Q,\\neg\\varphi\\rangle\\in F_*\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fragile} \\vdash \\mathrm{Fragile}(\\varphi,P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R,\\mathbf1_P,N,F_P,F_*\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FragileStructure}_S(\\varphi,P,R,\\mathbf1_P,N,F_P,F_*)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fragile} \\vdash \\mathrm{Fragile}(\\varphi,P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R,\\mathbf1_P,N,F_P,F_*\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FragileStructure}_S(\\varphi,P,R,\\mathbf1_P,N,F_P,F_*)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A statement is fragile if it can be destroyed by further forcing.  The forcing relations are represented by set codes; the nonexistent unary predicate <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Forcing}(P)\">\\(\\operatorname{Forcing}(P)\\)</span> is not used.</li>\n<li>GCH at singular cardinals is often fragile.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2$ (poset predicate, see [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"P,R,\\mathbf1_P,N,F_P,F_*\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FragileStructure}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fragile}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fragile\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{FragileStructure}_S(\\varphi,P,R,\\mathbf1_P,N,F_P,F_*)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{Poset}(P,R)\\land\\mathbf1_P\\in P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;(\\langle p,\\mathbf1_P\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land N\\subseteq V\\land F_P\\subseteq P\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\\\\n&{}\\land\\langle\\mathbf1_P,\\varphi\\rangle\\in F_P\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists\\dot Q\\in N\\;\\Bigl(\\langle\\mathbf1_P,\\ulcorner\\operatorname{Poset}(\\dot Q)\\urcorner\\rangle\\in F_P\\land\\langle\\dot Q,\\neg\\varphi\\rangle\\in F_*\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fragile} \\vdash \\mathrm{Fragile}(\\varphi,P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R,\\mathbf1_P,N,F_P,F_*\\in V\\;\\mathrm{FragileStructure}_S(\\varphi,P,R,\\mathbf1_P,N,F_P,F_*)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Forcing}(P)","display":false}],"bytes":1772,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-552","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-fragile.md|58-df-fragile]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2","d06ac5a66d69d291","d3f859dbdd37f018"]}